  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A symmetric star shaped conducting wire loop is carrying a steady state current <math> <mi>I</mi> </math> as shown in the figure. The distance between the diametrically opposite vertices of the star is <math><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math> .<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/190774q.png\"/></p>",
